sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (browser)
    participant DB as Dashboard (Next.js server)
    participant SA as Supabase Auth
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant PG as Supabase Postgres

    U->>DB: sign in (email + password, or GitHub / Google)
    DB->>SA: signInWithPassword / OAuth code exchange
    SA-->>DB: access token (ES256, 10 min) + refresh token
    DB-->>U: httpOnly session cookies (the browser never holds a gateway credential)

    U->>DB: open Settings
    DB->>DB: proxy refreshes the session, page calls getClaims() (verified)
    DB->>GW: GET /v1/me, Authorization: Bearer <access token>
    GW->>SA: JWKS (fetched once, then cached)
    GW->>GW: verify ES256, issuer, audience authenticated, exp, role
    GW->>PG: select private.session_is_active(session_id)

    alt session signed out (here or on all devices)
        PG-->>GW: false
        GW-->>DB: 401 session_revoked
        DB-->>U: "The API didn't accept your session"
    else session live
        PG-->>GW: true
        GW->>PG: upsert users row (at most every 5 min)
        GW->>PG: memberships → organization (X-Organization-Id or the only one)
        GW-->>DB: 200 CurrentUser { name, providers, organizations }
        DB-->>U: Settings with the user's organizations
    end
    Note over DB,GW: Server to server only (BFF), so no CORS and no token in the browser
